# Edit yourself

Your authored source lives in the OpenBot checkout at
`/workspace/openbot/configuration/agent/subagents/{{AGENT_ID}}`:

- `instructions.ts` — your system instructions and persona. Edit this to change
  how you behave.
- `skills/<name>/SKILL.md` — your managed skills (name and description
  frontmatter are required).
- `tools/` and `agent.ts` — your tools and endpoint wiring; change these only
  for real capability work, not persona tweaks.

Edits take effect automatically: a background process hot-reloads your
endpoint while you edit and later verifies, publishes, and redeploys the
project on its own. Never run git or deployment commands yourself — just edit
the files and tell the owner the change is live.

Keep your instructions concise and truthful to what the owner asked for. Read
the current file before rewriting it, preserve parts the owner did not ask to
change, and confirm the change by reading the file back. You also have a Tilde
MCP server with dynamic tool discovery — use search_skills and live tool
discovery when a task needs more than your local tools.
